{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You live in a dimly lit, exotic apartment basement in a small, cluttered office. You don\u2019t know what your neighbors are up to. But you want to know everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714150/extras/gif1.gif?t=1750162747\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Beyond the Doors, your job begins every night right when your neighbors shut their doors and disappear. Place recording devices near their doors. Build a chain to transmit the sound back to your basement office. Collect, analyze, and send these sounds to the people who request information from you each day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714150/extras/gif2.gif?t=1750162747\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you place more devices, your network will grow more complex. It's up to you to set up the right connections and fix broken network. Use the credits you earn to buy upgrades, merge tangled chains, and build the perfect network.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714150/extras/gif3.gif?t=1750162747\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Climb the stairs. Walk the halls. Dig through trash. Sometimes you\u2019ll find random documents or new devices to aid your mission. While doing all this, you may witness some mysterious events. Maybe there is a different universe waiting for you behind the doors you think you can't enter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714150/extras/gif4.gif?t=1750162747\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">First-person exploration of a mysterious and exotic apartment building in a retro 3D environment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Automation-based network building and optimization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Management of the economy with a collect-analyze-send loop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Devices and network upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Random events</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2714150?t=1750162747","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2714150?t=1750162747","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714150/6b85beb9dfd7020dbbebac514ca0914daf4fcdaa/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750162747","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714150/6b85beb9dfd7020dbbebac514ca0914daf4fcdaa/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750162747","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You live in a dimly lit, exotic apartment basement in a small, cluttered office. You don\u2019t know what your neighbors are up to. But you want to know everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714150/extras/gif1.gif?t=1750162747\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Beyond the Doors, your job begins every night right when your neighbors shut their doors and disappear. Place recording devices near their doors. Build a chain to transmit the sound back to your basement office. Collect, analyze, and send these sounds to the people who request information from you each day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714150/extras/gif2.gif?t=1750162747\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you place more devices, your network will grow more complex. It's up to you to set up the right connections and fix broken network. Use the credits you earn to buy upgrades, merge tangled chains, and build the perfect network.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714150/extras/gif3.gif?t=1750162747\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Climb the stairs. Walk the halls. Dig through trash. Sometimes you\u2019ll find random documents or new devices to aid your mission. While doing all this, you may witness some mysterious events. Maybe there is a different universe waiting for you behind the doors you think you can't enter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714150/extras/gif4.gif?t=1750162747\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">First-person exploration of a mysterious and exotic apartment building in a retro 3D environment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Automation-based network building and optimization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Management of the economy with a collect-analyze-send loop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Devices and network upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Random events</p></li></ul>","developers":["Dream Error"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714150/83a0670e4e5723c38554f57211d581ee286b98d9/header.jpg?t=1750162747","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"name":"Beyond the Doors","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> WIndows 10+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-6100 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX 960 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Dream Error"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia\nMedo\nLinguagem impr\u00f3pria","rating":"14","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"14","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Horror\nAlkohol / Tabak\nSchimpfw\u00f6rte","rating":"16","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"16","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"To be announced"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714150/4c901b8a278a5fe89bd560efb915c27e24c0e8b7/ss_4c901b8a278a5fe89bd560efb915c27e24c0e8b7.1920x1080.jpg?t=1750162747","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714150/4c901b8a278a5fe89bd560efb915c27e24c0e8b7/ss_4c901b8a278a5fe89bd560efb915c27e24c0e8b7.600x338.jpg?t=1750162747"},{"id":1,"p